  "description": "The Beyond AL Sword is a lightweight adventure bike crafted for those seeking a nimble and adaptable ride. Gear changes are managed by Microshift’s Sword mechanical drivetrain, offering dependable and smooth shifting, while TRP calipers paired with 180 / 160 mm rotors deliver strong and consistent braking. It incorporates all the hallmark Bombtrack elements, such as internal routing for dynamo cables, numerous mounting options on both the frame and fork, and compatibility with a dropper post. Smaller frame sizes feature 27.5” wheels, while sizes M through XL come equipped with 29” wheels. Both configurations include tubeless-ready WTB i23 rims fitted with 2.0” WTB Ranger tires, designed to handle diverse terrain so you can stay focused on the adventure ahead.\n\nWeight frame: 2145 g frame (size M, incl. TA, bolts, seatclamp, hanger)",
